    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tucked away on a generous and private site just off the highly sought-after Old Blackrock Road, Knockrea Cottage is a beautifully presented three-bedroom residence that seamlessly combines contemporary design with a peaceful setting. Occupying a mature site of approximately 0.22 acres, this exceptional home offers a rare opportunity to enjoy privacy and tranquillity while remaining just minutes from Cork City Centre.\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, the accommodation is both bright and spacious throughout. A welcoming entrance hall leads to the heart of the home an impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area. This wonderful space is flooded with natural light thanks to its triple-aspect windows, creating a bright and airy atmosphere throughout the day. Large glazed doors open directly onto a spacious terrace, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying the beautifully landscaped gardens.\nThe surrounding gardens are a particular feature of the property. Enclosed by mature planting and high boundary walls, they offer an exceptional degree of privacy and create a peaceful oasis rarely found so close to the city. Carefully maintained lawns and established shrubbery enhance the sense of seclusion while providing an attractive outlook from the principal living spaces.\nThe bedroom accommodation comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, each enjoying pleasant garden views and an abundance of natural light. A stylish and contemporary shower room serves the home and has been finished to a high standard.\nTo the front, the property benefits from ample off-street parking, while the mature setting further enhances its appeal. The combination of privacy, modern accommodation and a substantial site makes this a truly unique offering in one of Cork's most desirable residential locations.\nThe location is second to none. Situated just off the prestigious Old Blackrock Road, the property is within easy walking distance of Cork City Centre, Douglas Village and the Marina, offering an exceptional range of cafés, restaurants, shops and recreational amenities. Some of Cork's finest primary and secondary schools are nearby, while excellent public transport links and easy access to the South Link Road ensure convenient travel throughout the city and beyond.\nOffering contemporary living in a mature and established setting, The Bungalow represents a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish home in one of Cork's most prestigious and convenient addresses. Whether for families,  or those seeking to downsize without compromising on location or privacy, this outstanding property is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers."
      },
